    &KIND Al
      BASIS_SET TZVP-MOLOPT-SCAN-GTH-q3
      POTENTIAL GTH-SCAN-q3
    &END KIND
    &KIND B
      BASIS_SET TZVP-MOLOPT-SCAN-GTH-q3
      POTENTIAL GTH-SCAN-q3
    &END KIND
